Rule 1 (input tensor must not be boolean)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 2 (ELU expects floating-point tensor dtypes)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≥ 6 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 3 (alpha should be non-negative)
{v_2 : float} |= v_2 ≥ 0
>>
Rule 4 (inplace mode requires floating input dtype)
{v_1 : tensor, v_3 : bool} |= if v_3 then (dtype_(v_1) ≥ 6 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8)
>>
Rule 5 (tensor dimensions are non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
